t_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064504011:0":{"text":"分かっている……あの時も、すべてが絶望に包まれていた。そんな中、シルフィス様が私を救ってくれたのだ。","source_cn":"我知道……很多年前，也是这样绝望的时刻，是奥菲戈斯女士...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA827464966D04C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064504012:0":{"text":"今度は私が救う番だ……あの方の旋律で！","source_cn":"现在，即使我再也听不见……也要奏响她的旋律！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD17F9CB658DD00CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064504013:0":{"text":"リュートの音が響き始めた。だが、音を正確に聞き取れないバルトークの演奏は、本来のテンポからずれていた。","source_cn":"琴声响起。然而，因为巴托克听不清旋律，节拍却偏离了应有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x897C41004236C14A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064504014:1":{"text":"彼は大きく息を吸い込み、楽譜の書き込みを思い出す。指先に伝わる弦の震えを感じながら、徐々に本来の律動を取り戻していく……","source_cn":"他猛然深吸一口气，按照乐谱上的批注，感受着指尖的震动，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72224B1407A69714","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064504015:1":{"text":"流れるように拍がつながり、優雅で神聖な旋律がボーン城の空へと響き渡った。","source_cn":"断裂的节拍重新接续，优雅神圣的乐曲悠扬而出，笼罩在波恩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20B6CB8C5B3891E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"",